          "text": "Témoignages: MAGNY-LES-HAMEAUX (78) 06.02.2017",
          "text_sha256": "cb867494de846626d0dbdbfb38be4453e280ff64600be201038cde6f6374a218"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
